      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.00004,
        "t": 283.96987,
        "r": 552.0900400000003,
        "b": 260.72987
      },
      "content": "Observe the pump for vibration levels, bearing temperature, and excessive noise. If  normal levels are exceeded, shut down the pump and resolve the issue.",
